Mac Duo
Copyright 2026 Makito. Originally developed by Makito.
https://github.com/sumimakito/Mac-Duo
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Used for:
  - the square-to-quad (Heckbert) homography approach to perspective
  - sampling an MPSImageGaussianPyramid at a continuous mip level so that blur
    costs no separate pass
  - placing the overlay window at CGShieldingWindowLevel()
  - the ScreenCaptureKit "presence window" technique, which keeps a 1x1
    near-transparent window alive so the application is enumerable in
    SCShareableContent and can exclude itself from its own capture
  - documentation of HID feature report 7 (hundredths of a degree)
  - separate ramp exponents for blur and dimming

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LidAngleSensor
Copyright 2025 Sam Henri Gold
https://github.com/samhenrigold/LidAngleSensor
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Used for:
  - identification of the lid-angle HID device: vendor 0x05AC, product 0x8104,
    usage page 0x0020 (Sensor), usage 0x008A (Orientation)
  - the feature report 1 layout (3 bytes, little-endian, whole degrees)
  - the two-tier hardware probing approach that distinguishes "no sensor" from
    "sensor present but exposed on the vendor page"

