  Mac Duo        https://github.com/DhananjayBhosale/MacDuo
                 (by Dhananjay Bhosale, distinct from Makito's Mac-Duo)
                 verifying Screen Recording access through a real
                 SCShareableContent fetch rather than CGPreflightScreenCaptureAccess,
                 which can retain a stale result; the hysteresis dwell detector
                 used to learn a resting lid angle; Reduce Motion support

